        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidagasa NG'UTAMIIDA aba eaweega Yeremiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu heedeanyu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ang'iing'i maygeesheena, nea ea maynyasa diibiga haweega ea gea orjooga aba hiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda orjooga ea haweega sijiilsa hiji, ea aba badayda ghweaniga ea gheamadiga jiilu saawa aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula gaygahuuyda geeyooda muy. Nea ea manda fuga jea gooyeawda aba badahuuka nyaawa, ak hean eara fuga jea gabuy ea maygwanda; saawa gaygawuurji fiyeega dugwa mida mooheeda. Ak gaygahuuyda ng'uta ea geejeeda, nea muscheeka nyaawa gayghoah daghwarda dariidaka ea diyeanga jarooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA; adiidu guwi jeeda gheeda meewa ghana una heeda fuga gutu heareega, ghana giisana; aba gideaba naang'aami hoyyooydeanyu heedeaba fiisu, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, bariinyeegeasu bea huumwa ea baydeaydeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaygooshealsa hiji fuga hees ea gea manang'i; ak ea majeebuy, nea manda siichea gagutu heareega aba badahuuka nyaawa, ghana gwareekushi, ghana ghwalajaada geaw aba badahuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ea maygwanda siichea ghoadawa daghwarda, jea gageanda salagheang'da siida meewa fuga gheanyaawa nea ea maygwanda siichea ghoadaw gichea ghwali jea gageanda salagheang'da aba badayda miyeeda ghwaan ea ghaamwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gooweayi jeeda gealga mida ghweelmeeda ak goondeayi sea saawa, ak gooyeagiischi nea gooleeyshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA fuga Israeli: Ng'ula gaydaang'aamwa hiji bea madeedeang'wean ea madeeda eawoojigeagwean giijuureanda rearga ea hooseaneega, ea nyeashta orjeeda geeshi ea sibeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gayrukusiina fiisu ng'asheesu seaniin, ak gwayeeshiineey, ‘Ghwasaan NG'UTAMIIDA anda gwarugu ng'asheega munyas aba badaydeanya? Aseasa siitiinyi naaha? Aseasa sisinyi ana riing'a aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshiina saawa: Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Aba gideaba ghweanigeagwa ghayi ghaheawanaan, ak ghwaat geeshanga aseecheeka suuk ak ghabwat nea gagadiiyeesa, hean ea nijaktaneani nea ea mudu ghoang'waay huumeanyeekeasu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghamneawa aba gideaba noosinyi gea naawa gea ghweanigeagwa, ng'ula aba gidoodeeneawi, gaba siisi duup giidiinyeandaanyi, nea ghaheawa gooleeysean iita; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi ng'ula gaydaang'aamwaneegwa hiji ak ghaayaadeagwa ng'eanyiida moanali agooga sea ghweanigeagwa, ak aba hoowa gajabwada sanaamajeega eawa ea askweari, nea maydabwaydaneegwa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biiknooda sileabu giibaleakta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Asi ng'ula gayghapka eemoojiga jea ea maygudu eeyi, ‘Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi aruuna fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida Misri,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata, ‘Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi aruuna fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, ea jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi Hosa niny saawa.’ Aba gideaba gaydeadeelu jeeda ng'eanyiida nyaawa ghayi aadawji ghweaniga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lasooda jea ghwahidu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Ng'ula gaydeajeagu fuga saang'a daga ghweayeega ghapka ghoang'waay fiisu; aba ng'ata gaydeajeagu fuga bara shageata ak gaygahoona saawa aba uhuuda gilinyoo ea giija gil ea uhuuda gilinyoo ea heaya, ea jeemba gilinyoo gwaleamba lagheanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gheanyangeasu gang'ula naweadinga nyaawa, nea manda gichea ghafunyanaani, nea eara ramaseanyeeka nyaawa ea dahaachi aba gheanyangeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydawalda niba iyeenya ramaseanyeeka ea riing'eega nyaawa, aba gideaba ning'uda ririnnyeanda ng'eanyiideanyu aba muscheeka sanaamajeega nyaawa munyas, ak ea niinyiit hearaniischoodeanyu aba munyasnacheeka nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya ghamwaash ASEETA aba masaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi, ng'ula, gaydanung' ghwanal giteena uurdeanyu ea giimuusteanyu, ak gayghwanal gideaba gheawungeasu NG'UTAMIIDA gil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
